---
// Source-faithful SOPFlow V6 marketing surface.
---
<section aria-labelledby="hero-title" class="hero wrap">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="fanout-stage">
<div class="fan-card specimen specimen-left" data-float="left-top">
<div class="fan-top"><span class="fan-symbol">SOP</span><span class="fan-ref">SOP/DEMO/001</span></div>
<div class="paper-rule strong"></div><div class="paper-rule"></div>
<div class="paper-title">Pengajuan dan<br/>Verifikasi Dokumen</div>
<div class="paper-rule wide"></div><div class="paper-rule short"></div>
<div class="paper-table"><span>Kegiatan</span><span>Pelaksana</span><span>Mutu baku</span></div>
<div class="paper-table light"><span>Ajukan dokumen</span><span>Staff</span><span>15 menit</span></div>
<div class="paper-table light"><span>Dokumen valid?</span><span>Manager</span><span>10 menit</span></div>
</div>
<div class="fan-card validation-note" data-float="right-top">
<div class="fan-note-top"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M4 10.3 8.1 14 16 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path></svg><span>Validation</span></div>
<strong>Ready to review</strong>
<p>The document has no structural or SOP-AP readiness issues.</p>
<div class="fan-note-foot"><span class="ready-mark"></span> No issues found</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="hero-content">
<h1 id="hero-title">From SOP steps to<br/><span>clear workflows.</span></h1>
<p class="hero-sub">Design, visualize, and validate procedures in one connected workspace. Built on an open-source TypeScript toolkit.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas">
<a class="btn btn-dark" href="/playground/">Open playground <svg class="icon" style="width:16px;height:16px"><use href="#ic-arrow"></use></svg></a>
<a class="hero-link" href="#preview">See how it works <svg class="icon" style="width:15px;height:15px"><use href="#ic-arrow"></use></svg></a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
